## 2. What the Bot does

The Bot monitors the Steam depot for Animal Company (App ID 4551040) for
updates and generates remapped IL2CPP symbol files for personal use. It
provides the following slash commands:

- `/status` — show current build state
- `/check` — force a remap without committing state
- `/remap` — force a remap and commit the new build ID
- `/files` — list available output files
- `/bridge` — get the patched ac_bridge.js
- `/symbols` — get the current symbols.ts

